{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "44c40498-dca4-8d11-90aa-9a2ece5b5815",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T13:01:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sal Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:58:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:59:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Good afternoon. My name is Sal Grasso. I am calling about water, on the street, at the curb. It is, um, [inaudible] sorry, I am on the speaker, can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:59:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine, Mr. Grasso. Go ahead. Water at the curb, where is that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:59:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One twenty-eight Dixon Street. In the North End. The drain by the curb in front of my building, it does not take the water. Everything just sits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:59:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One twenty-eight Dixon Street. Okay. Has there been rain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:59:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no rain. No storm. Is dry, many days. It is the snow melting, from the pile, in the afternoon. The water comes down and makes a big puddle, big, all across the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:59:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's meltwater collecting by the drain and not going down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:59:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. And then at night it freezes. In the morning is black ice, you cannot see it. Somebody is going to slip. This is the third time I am telling this, I think. Nobody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:00:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. Let me get it down properly. Dixon Street, 128, the drain at the curb is blocked or not draining, and it's freezing overnight. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:00:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, right. And the children, they walk to the bus here. And people with the dogs, they walk right next to the water. Old people too. I am worried one falls in the street, into the cars."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:00:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a fair concern. I'll put it in as a drainage problem with an ice hazard so it gets looked at sooner. Can I have a callback number in case you're not home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:00:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:00:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-two. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:00:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please, do the crews come on the weekend? Because the ice is worst Saturday, Sunday, when everybody is out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:00:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do sometimes handle urgent things on weekends, but I'd rather get somebody out there before then. I'm marking it for this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:01:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That is good. I hope so. Sorry to complain, but it is every day the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:01:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need to apologize. The phones have been busy all afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:01:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I think so. Everybody is calling today, I could hear it, I waited long on the line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:01:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's that kind of Monday. Alright, Mr. Grasso, it's in. Somebody from our office will call you at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:01:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Lorraine. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:01:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Stay clear of that puddle."
    }
  ],
